\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {1}{\ignorespaces High-level overview of the attention-guided waste-classification framework. Raw landfill images are preprocessed, encoded by a frozen ImageNet-pretrained CNN, recalibrated by a channel-attention gate, and mapped to class probabilities by the classifier head. For every prediction a Grad-CAM heatmap can be produced for inspection.}}{2}{figure.1}\protected@file@percent }
