\newlabel{fig:methodology}{{5}{4}{Proposed methodological pipeline. The preprocessing phase loads, resizes and stratifies the raw landfill images; the training phase first performs backbone feature extraction, then channel-attention recalibration and classification, updating only the attention and classifier parameters; the testing phase restores the best checkpoint and produces predictions together with Grad-CAM heatmaps}{figure.5}{}}
