\@writefile{lof}{\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {6}{\ignorespaces Structure of the channel-attention gate. The final feature maps are pooled with global average and maximum pooling, concatenated, and passed through a two-layer bottleneck perceptron followed by a sigmoid activation; the resulting gate vector recalibrates the feature maps channel-wise.}}{5}{figure.6}\protected@file@percent }
