\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {4}{\ignorespaces Test performance (top-1 accuracy and macro-averaged precision, recall and $F_1$-score) of the seven attention-gated backbones on the RealWaste test set. The proposed DenseNet-121 framework performs best.}}{7}{table.caption.4}\protected@file@percent }
