\newlabel{fig:cm}{{8}{7}{Confusion matrices of DenseNet-121 with and without the channel-attention gate on the 713-image test set. The attention mechanism reduces cross-category confusion, most notably between Cardboard and Paper and between Plastic and Glass/Metal}{figure.8}{}}
